<article class="env-lemma" id="0FP5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FP5">Lemma <span data-tag="0FP5">20.31.6</span>.</a> Let $f : (X, \mathcal{O}_ X) \to (Y, \mathcal{O}_ Y)$ be a morphism of ringed spaces. The relative cup product of Remark <a href="/tag/0B68" data-tag="0B68">20.28.7</a> is commutative in the sense that the diagram </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ Rf_*K \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ Y}^\mathbf {L} Rf_*L \ar[r] \ar[d]_\psi &  Rf_*(K \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ X}^\mathbf {L} L) \ar[d]^{Rf_*\psi } \\  Rf_*L \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ Y}^\mathbf {L} Rf_*K \ar[r] &  Rf_*(L \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ X}^\mathbf {L} K) }  \]
</div>
  <p> is commutative in $D(\mathcal{O}_ Y)$ for all $K, L$ in $D(\mathcal{O}_ X)$. Here $\psi $ is the commutativity constraint on the derived category (Lemma <a href="/tag/0FPB" data-tag="0FPB">20.50.6</a>). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
